# Secrets — structural guarantee (CLAUDE.md: "Never commit secrets", P3).
# Real secrets live only in these files locally and in the platform's env-var UI in prod.
# The repo carries .env.example with placeholders only — that one is tracked (negated below).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
secrets.json
service-account*.json
# Firebase Admin SDK private keys download as <project>-firebase-adminsdk-<id>-<id>.json,
# which service-account*.json does not match. Both spellings, so the file is unstageable
# wherever it lands rather than wherever someone remembered to rename it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*adminsdk*.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Java / Maven
target/
*.class
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/

# Build output
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Expo / React Native (ADR-010: Android release builds are made locally)
.expo/
.expo-shared/
android/app/build/
android/build/
android/.gradle/
android/local.properties
ios/build/
ios/Pods/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp

# Scratch / temp — NOT specs or tickets: those are tracked under docs/plans/
.scratch/
tmp/
*.log

# Editor config (personal, not project rules - those live in CLAUDE.md)
.vscode/

# Testcontainers credential-helper workaround (CLAUDE.md, S1.2) — a throwaway DOCKER_CONFIG dir
backend/cfg/
docs/plans/S4.29-invite-meta-card/verification/index.html
